# Pattern Catalog LLM Guide

Use this module when work touches Pattern manifests, roles, includes, ladders,
or `workspace.recipe.roles_map`.

## Rules

- Keep Pattern manifest data and validation types in `domain.py`.
- Keep YAML/config/workspace loading in `infrastructure.py`.
- Keep catalog queries and validation orchestration in `application.py`.
- Do not move rendering, file materialization, drift, or bench logic here.
- Use `settings.metadata.recipes_dir` for the recipe root and feature-owned recipe path helpers for manifest filenames.
